ver of  her magazine to feature brianna  would you be content to hear five months  later  there's an investigation and that no one  has been held accountable for shooting  your  innocent daughter multiple times  and letting her life bleed out the media  mogul also paid for dozens of billboards  around louisville kentucky  in effort to amplify brianna's story and  to seek justice for her death  these 26 billboards won for  every year of brianna's life are my  offering  my form of protest we cannot  be silent we have to use whatever  megaphone we have  to cry for justice
 

